msgid "The YAML plugin requires PHP %s or later. This server runs PHP %s, so the plugin was not installed or enabled."
msgstr "Die YAML-inprop vereis PHP %s of later. Hierdie bediener loop PHP %s, dus is die inprop nie geïnstalleer of geaktiveer nie."

